WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:01.750
- You got a new tattoo
since last time I saw you,

00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:03.040
can I see it?

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:05.410
- The last one was probably

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:08.086
one of the things from the golden record.

00:00:08.086 --> 00:00:09.160
- [Kelly Clarkson] Yeah.

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:10.551
- And the first one,

00:00:10.551 --> 00:00:11.384
- [Kelly Clarkson] What's the first one?

00:00:11.384 --> 00:00:13.210
- which is also science-related is this,

00:00:13.210 --> 00:00:14.810
- [Kelly Clarkson] That looks
like Mission Impossible code.

00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:17.070
- Right? So, right before I turned 40,

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:18.750
I was like, "I'm gonna do it."

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:19.980
I've wanted them for so long.

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:20.813
- [Kelly Clarkson] Yeah.

00:00:20.813 --> 00:00:22.630
- I went on that show,
"Finding Your Roots".

00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:23.463
Do you know that show?

00:00:23.463 --> 00:00:25.638
- Oh! No, but I did something like it.

00:00:25.638 --> 00:00:26.471
- Okay.

00:00:26.471 --> 00:00:27.304
- "Who Do You Think You
Are?" I did something that,

00:00:27.304 --> 00:00:28.270
yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:29.103
- Yeah, so, somewhere where they like,

00:00:29.103 --> 00:00:30.322
- Yeah.
- do your DNA,

00:00:30.322 --> 00:00:31.155
- Yeah.
- do those genealogy things.

00:00:31.155 --> 00:00:31.988
- Yeah. Yeah.

00:00:31.988 --> 00:00:33.860
- So, I thought, "Right,
well, whatever they teach me,

00:00:33.860 --> 00:00:35.010
I'll get my first tattoo".

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:36.327
And I went on that show thinking like,

00:00:36.327 --> 00:00:38.970
"I wanna find out that
I'm a third Scottish

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:40.385
and I can get a family crest."

00:00:40.385 --> 00:00:41.218
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:41.218 --> 00:00:42.449
Yeah, you all are
laughing 'cause you know,

00:00:42.449 --> 00:00:43.449
(audience laughing)

00:00:43.449 --> 00:00:45.163
but you know what I
mean, like, in your head

00:00:45.163 --> 00:00:46.334
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:46.334 --> 00:00:47.167
I'm like, "There's gonna
be something cool."

00:00:47.167 --> 00:00:48.000
- Yeah. There's gonna be something random.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:49.442
- All those commercials say that

00:00:49.442 --> 00:00:50.275
you're gonna find out something random.

00:00:50.275 --> 00:00:51.108
- Yeah (laughing).

00:00:51.108 --> 00:00:52.560
- So, I do the show and
six months later, you go in

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:53.727
and they film everything and they go,

00:00:53.727 --> 00:00:56.765
"You are 99.9% South
Asian. How do you feel?"

00:00:56.765 --> 00:00:58.484
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:58.484 --> 00:00:59.584
(audience clapping)

00:00:59.584 --> 00:01:00.417
- And I just blurted out like,

00:01:00.417 --> 00:01:01.884
- You are 100% that bitch.

00:01:01.884 --> 00:01:03.404
- literally I was like, yeah, exactly.

00:01:03.404 --> 00:01:04.921
(audience clapping)
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:04.921 --> 00:01:05.754
I was like, "Yeah, I know.
It's so disappointing."

00:01:05.754 --> 00:01:06.712
They're like,

00:01:06.712 --> 00:01:08.220
"Oh, you're disappointed in who you are?"

00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:09.127
And I'm like, "No, no,
that's not what I said."

00:01:09.127 --> 00:01:10.087
- Don't quote me (laughing).

00:01:10.087 --> 00:01:14.700
- But they did show me this
map with number, "R1a-M147",

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:16.650
- which is a maternal haplogroup

00:01:16.650 --> 00:01:17.570
that you share with millions

00:01:17.570 --> 00:01:18.410
and millions of other people,

00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:20.178
and it's basically your DNA ancestry.

00:01:20.178 --> 00:01:21.011
- [Kelly Clarkson] Oh!

00:01:21.011 --> 00:01:21.960
And I was like, "That's
gonna be my first tattoo."

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:22.793
- That's super cool!

00:01:22.793 --> 00:01:23.748
- 'cause it's science.

00:01:23.748 --> 00:01:24.581
- Yeah.

00:01:24.581 --> 00:01:25.680
- Now, that said, I then went

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:27.820
and bought my own DNA testing kit

00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:29.397
to see what else was in there.

00:01:29.397 --> 00:01:30.230
- [Kelly Clarkson] Yeah.

00:01:30.230 --> 00:01:31.760
- And that came four months after that,

00:01:31.760 --> 00:01:34.210
and I'm on my computer, logging in,

00:01:34.210 --> 00:01:35.043
and
- Oh no.

00:01:35.043 --> 00:01:37.090
I see that maternal haplogroup,

00:01:37.090 --> 00:01:38.730
which I have tattooed at that point,

00:01:38.730 --> 00:01:41.130
that says, "R1a-M147",
- Is not?

00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:43.537
on the computer it says, "R1a-M417".

00:01:44.536 --> 00:01:47.471
(audience laughing)

00:01:47.471 --> 00:01:48.304
- Oh,

00:01:48.304 --> 00:01:50.445
- You all are laughing.
You're so gleeful aren't you?

00:01:50.445 --> 00:01:51.700
- my, I am.

00:01:51.700 --> 00:01:53.700
- My partner, Josh, was home at the time,

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:55.370
and I was like, "Dude, come over here.

00:01:55.370 --> 00:01:57.391
What is the deal with this? R1a-"

00:01:57.391 --> 00:01:58.290
- [Kelly Clarkson] Is this real?

00:01:58.290 --> 00:01:59.123
- Is this real?

00:01:59.123 --> 00:02:00.944
And the gleeful look on his face.

00:02:00.944 --> 00:02:01.980
(Kelly laughing)

00:02:01.980 --> 00:02:03.990
Like, I have never seen him happier

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:06.007
and just be like, "Ha, ha, ha!".

00:02:06.007 --> 00:02:06.850
(Kelly laughing)

00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:08.410
And then I emailed them all, and you know,

00:02:08.410 --> 00:02:09.757
it was like, "Yo, what's the deal,"

00:02:09.757 --> 00:02:10.590
- [Kelly Clarkson] How dare you?

00:02:10.590 --> 00:02:11.870
- Yeah, but now I kept it,
'cause it's a good story.

00:02:11.870 --> 00:02:13.790
- My first tattoo is a
Japanese Kanji character

00:02:13.790 --> 00:02:15.810
and they said, it means "blessed",

00:02:15.810 --> 00:02:17.210
and then I was like,
"Yeah, that's awesome."

00:02:17.210 --> 00:02:18.724
I was like 18-years-old. I
was like, "This is cool."

00:02:18.724 --> 00:02:19.557
- [Kal Penn] Yeah. Yeah.

00:02:19.557 --> 00:02:20.550
- My place had just burned down,

00:02:20.550 --> 00:02:21.383
I wasn't in it,

00:02:21.383 --> 00:02:22.520
so that's a blessing,

00:02:22.520 --> 00:02:23.658
- [Kal Penn] Yeah, totally.

00:02:23.658 --> 00:02:24.491
- and so, I love irony,

00:02:24.491 --> 00:02:25.750
and so I literally got it done,

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:27.857
and when I went to Japan,
I was literally like,

00:02:27.857 --> 00:02:29.838
"Please dear God, tell
me this means 'blessed'".

00:02:29.838 --> 00:02:30.671
(Kal laughing)

00:02:30.671 --> 00:02:32.659
I was like 21 and they were
like, "It means 'blessed'

00:02:32.659 --> 00:02:35.088
but it also means like someone's surname",

00:02:35.088 --> 00:02:36.168
it's a family name.

00:02:36.168 --> 00:02:37.660
(Kal laughing)

00:02:37.660 --> 00:02:40.370
So, I just have like someone's
family name on my body.

00:02:40.370 --> 00:02:41.290
It's fine.
(Kal laughing)

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:43.090
We make really good decisions at 18.

